{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P4_001", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 4, "pages": [4], "text": "「 動議 待召開股東週年大會通告( 「 通告 」 )所載第 5 及第 6 項決議案獲通過 後,透過在董事依據該項一般授權可配發及發行或同意有條件或無條件將 予配發及發行的股份總數(括任何銷售或轉讓自庫存的庫存股份)上,加 入本公司依據通告所載第 5 項決議案提述的授權所購回股份的數目,擴大通 告所載第 6 項決議案提述的一般授權,惟此股份數目不得超過本公司於本決 議案獲通過當日的已發行股份總數(不括庫存股份)的 10% (倘於通過本 決議案之日後進行任何本公司股份合併或分拆,則可予調整) 。」", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": null, "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/52"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/52", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 4, "bbox": [136.23, 108.82, 510.28, 226.11], "source_block_id": "#/texts/52", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [136.23, 108.82, 510.28, 226.11], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 47, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P5_001", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "附註:", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": null, "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/59"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/59", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [83.8, 72.95, 113.16, 80.08], "source_block_id": "#/texts/59", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [83.8, 72.95, 113.16, 80.08], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 48, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L5_001", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "根據香港聯合交易所有限公司證券上市規則( 「 上市規則 」 ) ,股東週年大會上所有決議案將以投票 方式表決(惟若決議案與程序或行政事宜有關,則主席可決定容許該決議案以舉手方式表決) 。投 票結果將按照上市規則規定刊載於香港交易及結算所有限公司及本公司網站。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": null, "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/60"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/60", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [85.04, 100.46, 510.26, 136.09], "source_block_id": "#/texts/60", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [85.04, 100.46, 510.26, 136.09], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 49, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L5_002", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "凡有權出席股東週年大會及在會上投票的本公司股東( 「 股東 」 ) ,均可委派一名或多名代表作為其 代表代其出席及在以投票方式表決時代其投票。受委代表毋須為股東。若委派一名以上代表,相關 代表委任表格上必須註明每一名受委代表所代表的股份數目。親自出席或委派代表出席的每位股東 有權對其持有的每一股股份投一票。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": null, "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/61"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/61", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [85.03, 156.47, 510.26, 206.1], "source_block_id": "#/texts/61", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [85.03, 156.47, 510.26, 206.1], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 50, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L5_003", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "代表委任表格及已簽署的授權書或其他授權文件(如有)或該等授權書或授權文件的經公證人核證 副本,須不遲於大會或其續會(視情況而定)指定舉行時間 48 小時之前(即不遲於 2025 年 6 月 18 日 (星期三)上午 10 時正(香港時間) )送達本公司的香港證券登記分處卓佳證券登記有限公司,地址 為香港夏愨道 16 號遠東金融中心 17 樓,方為有效。填妥及交回代表委任表格後,股東仍可親身出 席股東週年大會並於會上投票;在此情況下,上述代表委任表格將被視為撤銷論。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": null, "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/62"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/62", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [85.04, 226.96, 510.27, 290.12], "source_block_id": "#/texts/62", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [85.04, 226.96, 510.27, 290.12], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 51, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "title", "paragraph_id": "H5_001", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "4. 本公司將於下列期間暫停辦理股份過戶登記手續：", "block_type": "title", "source_parser": "docling", "source_block_id": "#/texts/63", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/63"], "bbox": [85.03940000000011, 310.97840000000025, 316.11440000000016, 318.38277416481094], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [85.03940000000011, 310.97840000000025, 316.11440000000016, 318.38277416481094], "source_block_id": "#/texts/63", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "mixed", "merge_method": "docling_semantic_title", "document_order": 52}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L5_004", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "(a) 為釐定出席股東週年大會及於會上投票的資格,本公司將於 2025 年 6 月 17 日(星期二)至 2025 年 6 月 20 日(星期五) (括首尾兩天)期間暫停辦理股份過戶登記手續。為符合資格出 席股東週年大會及在會上投票,本公司股份的未登記持有人須確保所有過戶文件連同有關 股票最遲於 2025 年 6 月 16 日(星期一)下午 4 時 30 分前送達本公司的香港證券登記分處卓佳證 券登記有限公司,地址為香港夏愨道 16 號遠東金融中心 17 樓,以作登記。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "4. 本公司將於下列期間暫停辦理股份過戶登記手續:", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/64"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/64", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [113.39, 338.98, 510.33, 402.4], "source_block_id": "#/texts/64", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [113.39, 338.98, 510.33, 402.4], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 53, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L5_005", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "(b) 為確定股東有資格獲派建議末期股息(須待股東於股東週年大會上批准) ,本公司將於 2025 年 7 月 7 日(星期一)至 2025 年 7 月 9 日(星期三) (括首尾兩天)暫停辦理股份過戶登記手 續,期間將不會辦理任何股份轉讓登記。為符合資格獲取建議末期股息,所有股份過戶文 件連同有關股票必須於 2025 年 7 月 4 日(星期五)下午 4 時 30 分前送達本公司之香港證券登記 分處卓佳證券登記有限公司,地址為香港夏愨道 16 號遠東金融中心 17 樓,以作登記。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "4. 本公司將於下列期間暫停辦理股份過戶登記手續:", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/65"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/65", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [113.39, 422.99, 510.24, 486.41], "source_block_id": "#/texts/65", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [113.39, 422.99, 510.24, 486.41], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 54, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
