{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "P5_002", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "於本通告日期,本公司董事會成員括主席兼執行董事鍾慧娟女士、執行董事孫 遠女士及呂愛鋒博士;及獨立非執行董事林國強先生、陳尚偉先生及楊東濤女士。", "block_type": "paragraph", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": "5. 本通告內所有時間及日期均指香港時間及日期。", "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/67"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/67", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [83.53, 537.62, 511.02, 564.34], "source_block_id": "#/texts/67", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [83.53, 537.62, 511.02, 564.34], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 56, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
